---
import './library.css';
import AnimeEnrichment from './AnimeEnrichment.astro';

interface Props {
  endpoint?: '/api/rhea/telegram-mtproto' | '/api/relay/telegram-mtproto';
  autoLoad?: boolean;
  animeMetadataEndpoint?: string;
}

const { endpoint = '/api/rhea/telegram-mtproto', autoLoad = true, animeMetadataEndpoint = '/api/rhea/anime-metadata' } = Astro.props;
const letters = [...'ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ', '#'];
---
<div class="library" data-rhea-telegram-library data-telegram-endpoint={endpoint} data-telegram-autoload={String(autoLoad)} data-anime-metadata-endpoint={animeMetadataEndpoint}>
  <section class="library-inventory library-demo prism-surface" aria-labelledby="mtproto-title">
    <div>
      <h2 id="mtproto-title">Histórico do Telegram</h2>
      <p id="mtproto-status" role="status">Verificando se o leitor está disponível.</p>
    </div>
    <div id="mtproto-controls" class="library-actions">
      <button class="editorial-action" type="button" id="mtproto-start" hidden>Enviar código</button>
      <form id="mtproto-code" class="library-form" method="post" hidden>
        <label>Código do Telegram <input id="mtproto-code-input" type="password" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="one-time-code" pattern="[0-9]{4,8}" maxlength="8" required></label>
        <button class="editorial-action" type="submit">Confirmar código</button>
      </form>
      <form id="mtproto-password" class="library-form" method="post" hidden>
        <label>Senha em duas etapas <input id="mtproto-password-input" type="password" autocomplete="off" maxlength="256" required></label>
        <button class="editorial-action" type="submit">Confirmar senha</button>
      </form>
      <button class="editorial-action" type="button" id="mtproto-cancel" hidden>Cancelar conexão</button>
      <button class="editorial-action" type="button" id="mtproto-inventory" hidden>Ler histórico</button>
      <button class="editorial-action" type="button" id="mtproto-disconnect" hidden>Desconectar Telegram</button>
    </div>
  </section>
  <dialog id="mtproto-stage-dialog" aria-labelledby="mtproto-stage-title">
    <h2 id="mtproto-stage-title">Aprovar cópia para o canal de teste</h2>
    <p id="mtproto-stage-channels"></p>
    <ol id="mtproto-stage-posts"></ol>
    <p>A cópia usa esta ordem. Os posts do canal de origem permanecem como estão. A aprovação vale por cinco minutos.</p>
    <div class="library-actions">
      <form method="dialog"><button class="editorial-action" autofocus>Voltar</button></form>
      <button class="editorial-action relay-primary" type="button" id="mtproto-stage-confirm">Aprovar e copiar os três posts</button>
    </div>
  </dialog>
  <details class="library-section" id="mal-settings">
    <summary><strong>Configurar MyAnimeList</strong></summary>
    <form class="library-form" id="mal-client-form" method="post">
      <label>Client ID do MyAnimeList
        <input id="mal-client-id" type="password" minlength="32" maxlength="32" pattern="[A-Fa-f0-9]{32}" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" required>
      </label>
      <div class="library-actions">
        <button class="editorial-action rhea-primary" type="submit">Usar nesta sessão</button>
        <button class="editorial-action" id="mal-client-clear" type="button" hidden>Remover Client ID da sessão</button>
      </div>
    </form>
    <p id="mal-client-status" role="status">Use o Client ID do aplicativo cadastrado no MyAnimeList.</p>
  </details>
  <details class="library-section" id="forum-inventory" open>
    <summary><strong>Arquivos por tópico</strong></summary>
    <p>Carregue os tópicos, selecione Requests e escolha a obra que deseja organizar.</p>
    <div class="library-actions">
      <button class="editorial-action" id="forum-load" type="button">Ler tópicos</button>
      <button class="editorial-action" id="forum-more-topics" type="button" hidden>Carregar mais tópicos</button>
    </div>
    <p id="forum-status" role="status">Escolha o tópico para ler os metadados.</p>
    <div class="library-form">
      <label><span id="forum-topic-label">Tópico</span><select id="forum-topic" aria-labelledby="forum-topic-label" disabled><option value="">Escolha um tópico</option></select></label>
      <label>Buscar nos posts carregados<input id="forum-query" type="search" maxlength="120"></label>
      <label>Lista de nomes no Markdown<input id="forum-reference" type="file" accept=".md,.markdown,text/plain,text/markdown"></label>
    </div>
    <div class="library-actions forum-next-actions">
      <button class="editorial-action rhea-primary" id="forum-organize" type="button" hidden>Organizar arquivos deste tópico</button>
      <button class="editorial-action" id="forum-more-posts" type="button" hidden>Ler página anterior do tópico</button>
    </div>
    <p id="forum-reference-status" role="status"></p>
    <p id="forum-size-total" hidden></p>
    <details id="forum-size-by-season" hidden>
      <summary>Tamanho por obra e seção</summary>
      <p>Inclui arquivos carregados com nome correspondente no Markdown.</p>
      <ul id="forum-size-list"></ul>
    </details>
    <div id="forum-items" class="library-catalog"></div>
    <div class="library-actions">
      <button class="editorial-action" id="forum-more-results" type="button" hidden>Exibir mais itens carregados</button>
    </div>
  </details>
  <AnimeEnrichment />
  <details class="library-section" id="anime-metadata">
    <summary><strong>Consultar dados de anime</strong></summary>
    <p>Digite o título da obra ou temporada. A consulta envia apenas o título à fonte escolhida.</p>
    <form class="library-form" id="anime-lookup-form" method="post">
      <label>Título <input id="anime-title" type="search" minlength="2" maxlength="120" placeholder="Kaguya-sama wa Kokurasetai?: Tensaitachi no Renai Zunousen" required></label>
      <label>Fonte da consulta <select id="anime-provider"><option value="anilist">AniList</option><option value="mal">MyAnimeList</option></select></label>
      <div class="library-actions">
        <button class="editorial-action rhea-primary" type="submit">Buscar no AniList</button>
        <button class="editorial-action" id="anime-example" type="button">Usar Kaguya-sama na busca</button>
      </div>
    </form>
    <p id="anime-lookup-status" role="status"></p>
    <div id="anime-lookup-results" class="library-catalog"></div>
  </details>
  <details class="library-section" id="library-sandbox">
    <summary><strong>Ferramentas de teste</strong></summary>
    <div class="library-actions">
      <button class="editorial-action" type="button" id="mtproto-stagepreview" hidden>Preparar cópia de teste</button>
    </div>
    <details class="library-section" id="mirror-panel">
      <summary><strong>Espelhamento por tópico</strong></summary>
      <p>Piloto entre supergrupos privados descartáveis. Revise a origem e o destino antes de aprovar a cópia.</p>
      <p id="mirror-status" role="status"></p>
      <div class="library-actions">
        <button class="editorial-action" id="mirror-check" type="button">Consultar progresso</button>
        <button class="editorial-action" id="mirror-preview" type="button">Preparar prévia</button>
        <button class="editorial-action rhea-primary" id="mirror-continue" type="button" hidden>Continuar cópia</button>
        <button class="editorial-action" id="mirror-pause" type="button" hidden>Pausar após o lote atual</button>
      </div>
      <details id="mirror-receipts" hidden><summary>IDs conferidos</summary><ol id="mirror-mapping"></ol></details>
    </details>
    <dialog id="mirror-dialog" aria-labelledby="mirror-title">
      <h2 id="mirror-title">Aprovar cópia do tópico de teste</h2>
      <p>Origem · <strong id="mirror-source"></strong></p>
      <p>Destino · <strong id="mirror-destination"></strong></p>
      <ol id="mirror-posts" class="library-order"></ol>
      <p>A aprovação vale por cinco minutos. Os posts no destino terão novos IDs e links.</p>
      <div class="library-actions">
        <form method="dialog"><button class="editorial-action" autofocus>Voltar</button></form>
        <button class="editorial-action rhea-primary" id="mirror-approve" type="button">Aprovar cópia</button>
      </div>
    </dialog>

  </details>
    <section class="library-inventory library-demo prism-surface" aria-labelledby="demo-title">
      <div>
        <h2 id="demo-title">Catálogo do Telegram</h2>
        <p id="inventory-source">Carregue um tópico para ver as obras do seu acervo.</p>
      </div>
      <dl>
        <div><dt>Séries</dt><dd id="series-count">—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Mensagens</dt><dd id="message-count">—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Para revisar</dt><dd id="duplicate-count">—</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section class="library-section" id="catalogo" aria-labelledby="catalog-title">
      <div class="library-heading">
        <h2 id="catalog-title">Catálogo A–Z</h2>
        <label class="library-search">Buscar por título ou variante
          <input id="library-query" type="search" maxlength="120" placeholder="Busque uma obra cadastrada">
        </label>
      </div>
      <nav class="library-alphabet" aria-label="Filtrar catálogo por inicial">
        <button type="button" data-letter="" aria-pressed="true">Todas</button>
        {letters.map(letter => <button type="button" data-letter={letter} aria-pressed="false">{letter}</button>)}
      </nav>
      <p class="meta" id="catalog-result" role="status">Carregue um tópico para começar.</p>
      <div id="catalog-items" class="library-catalog"></div>
    </section>

    <section class="library-section" id="duplicatas" aria-labelledby="duplicates-title">
      <h2 id="duplicates-title">Possíveis duplicatas</h2>
      <p>O catálogo preserva todos os posts até você conferir os registros.</p>
      <ul id="duplicate-items" class="library-duplicates"></ul>
    </section>

    <section class="library-section" id="correcoes" aria-labelledby="correction-title">
      <h2 id="correction-title">Corrigir metadados</h2>
      <p>As correções valem para o catálogo nesta sessão. Os campos originais ficam visíveis no catálogo.</p>
      <form id="correction-form" class="library-form">
        <label>Post<select id="correction-id" required></select></label>
        <label>Série<select id="correction-series" required></select></label>
        <label>Temporada<input id="correction-season" type="number" min="0" max="99999"></label>
        <label>Episódio<input id="correction-episode" type="number" min="0" max="99999" step="any"></label>
        <label>Parte<input id="correction-part" type="number" min="1" max="99999"></label>
        <label>Tipo<select id="correction-kind"></select></label>
        <label>Nome de exibição<input id="correction-label" type="text" maxlength="160"></label>
        <div class="library-actions">
          <button class="editorial-action rhea-primary" type="submit">Aplicar ao catálogo</button>
          <button class="editorial-action" id="correction-reset" type="button">Redefinir</button>
        </div>
      </form>
      <p class="meta" id="correction-feedback" role="status"></p>
    </section>

</div>
<script>
  import './preview.mjs';
  import './mtproto-panel.mjs';
  import './forum-panel.mjs';
  import './mirror-panel.mjs';
  import './anime-metadata-panel.mjs';
</script>
